        {
          "handle": "dnystedt",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Nvidia’s next generation chip platform, Feynman is ahead of schedule, will use TSMC’s A16 process, and CPO (co-packaged optics), DigiTimes reports, with TSMC full speed ahead to meet 2028 mass production.  -Nvidia is rapidly shifting its supply chain to put Feynman out in the 2nd",
